quill-test-icons.{ttf,woff,woff2}: a few glyphs of DejaVu Sans Bold (Bitstream Vera / DejaVu license, free to
redistribute) with the square (U+25A0) also mapped at U+E900 and "Q" at U+E901, like an icon font. Made with
fontTools (subset, then saved as TrueType / WOFF / WOFF2). Used by the browser tests for @font-face.
